# NOT in any gate: it restarts and kills nodes, so it is an operational recipe with a recorded
# result rather than a pass/fail contract. A rolling VERSION upgrade is deliberately NOT covered --
# it needs a second image digest and a second from-source artifact build. See yb/RUNBOOK.md §5.
[doc("Node restart, node failure with writes continuing, and rejoin -- with kmoney data resident.")]
yb-resilience tag="":
